# Q19 What is a Party, and how is it different from a Customer Account? (two classes, each defined; an account is not a kind of party)
PREFIX party: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?party ?account WHERE {
  party:Party skos:definition ?party .
  party:CustomerAccount skos:definition ?account .
  party:transactsThrough rdfs:domain party:Party ; rdfs:range party:CustomerAccount .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { party:CustomerAccount rdfs:subClassOf* party:Party }
} LIMIT 1
